38:19.360 --> 38:21.490
Hari ini, jika awak mahu mereka hidup,

38:21.840 --> 38:23.410
awak bunuhlah diri di sini!

38:24.710 --> 38:26.240
Berani awak mengugut beta?

38:29.880 --> 38:30.670
Zhi Xia,

38:30.690 --> 38:31.840
